[Db7]Blow the trumpet, trusty [Ab]watchman, [Fm]Blow it [Db]loud o'er land and [C]sea;
[Ab]God commissions, sound the mes[Ab7] [Db]sage! Every captive [Ab]may [Eb7]be[Ab]free.

